WEBVTT

01:13.000 --> 01:18.600
[Meet Yourself]

01:19.050 --> 01:23.700
[Episode 25]

02:08.162 --> 02:09.411
What are you looking at?

02:09.412 --> 02:10.812
Why are you laughing so happily?

02:11.882 --> 02:13.211
Am I disturbing you?

02:13.212 --> 02:13.692
No. Not at all.

02:13.693 --> 02:14.561
I've finished writing it.

02:14.562 --> 02:15.772
Just check again.

02:29.372 --> 02:32.092
Why aren't Hongdou and Hu back yet?

02:32.812 --> 02:34.211
The singer in the town bar has left,

02:34.212 --> 02:36.052
so Hu went to the bar for an audition today

02:36.412 --> 02:39.531
Hongdou should be
playing mahjong at Mr. Xie's.

02:39.532 --> 02:41.772
Granny Xie has recently become
addicted to playing mahjong.

02:43.482 --> 02:45.282
This progress bar is too slow.

02:45.412 --> 02:46.601
What progress bar?

02:46.602 --> 02:48.252
The progress bar of love.

02:49.162 --> 02:51.531
There is no progress bar of
love between the two of them.

02:51.532 --> 02:54.651
Hongdou has been here too short,
only two or three months.

02:54.652 --> 02:57.091
When she leaves,
they'll be going their separate ways.

02:57.092 --> 02:59.772
There won't be romance
between them at all.

03:02.212 --> 03:03.332
No.

03:04.042 --> 03:07.332
I don't think it has
anything to do with time.

03:07.562 --> 03:10.721
You know This is not
where her career is headed.

03:10.722 --> 03:12.001
Marriage nowadays is not like in old times

03:12.002 --> 03:13.531
when where the needle goes, the thread follows.

03:13.532 --> 03:15.682
A girl has to consider
the whole picture.

03:17.162 --> 03:18.258
That's right.

03:18.282 --> 03:19.682
Career first.

03:20.132 --> 03:20.851
Exactly.

03:20.852 --> 03:22.131
Career comes first.

03:22.132 --> 03:23.251
When you have your career,

03:23.252 --> 03:25.252
then you can start to pursue other things.

03:26.602 --> 03:28.212
You're right.

03:28.372 --> 03:29.652
But Huang,

03:30.212 --> 03:33.001
you've come here to work
on your business for so long.

03:33.002 --> 03:35.052
Why don't you find a boyfriend here, though?

03:35.812 --> 03:36.962
I have a boyfriend.

03:38.282 --> 03:39.851
He is a teacher in Guizhou Province.

03:39.852 --> 03:41.372
We were just together last month.

03:41.602 --> 03:44.402
Why do you have the time
to find a boyfriend in Guizhou?

03:46.602 --> 03:49.122
Last summer I went to
Guizhou to visit my parents.

03:49.252 --> 03:51.721
My mom told me before I
went to Guizhou that they had

03:51.722 --> 03:54.761
a new volunteer teacher
which was definitely my type.

03:54.762 --> 03:57.052
They were effusive
in their praise for him.

03:58.042 --> 04:00.811
When I arrived,
I saw him in person.

04:00.812 --> 04:02.971
The young man is indeed a gentleman

04:02.972 --> 04:05.532
who always speaks tenderly
and has a dependable disposition.

04:05.852 --> 04:08.561
Most importantly,
he'll be shy if you look straight at him.

04:08.562 --> 04:09.882
And his face turns flushed.

04:11.532 --> 04:14.642
My mom knows my
preference so well.

04:15.412 --> 04:17.852
I can't believe your mom introduced him to you.

04:18.892 --> 04:21.451
I also have a good impression
of him so we keep in touch.

04:21.452 --> 04:23.851
And we decided to confess
our love for each other,

04:23.852 --> 04:25.492
and become a couple.

04:26.602 --> 04:30.682
So you two are having a
long-distance online relationship.

04:33.162 --> 04:34.612
But now I have an idea

04:35.282 --> 04:37.411
that I want to poach
him here from my mom.

04:37.412 --> 04:39.281
Our school is also short of teachers.

04:39.282 --> 04:40.402
Is he willing to do so?

04:40.772 --> 04:41.698
He...

04:41.722 --> 04:43.372
He is reluctant for the moment.

04:43.772 --> 04:45.252
Let your mom talk to him.

04:45.362 --> 04:46.681
My mom is even more reluctant.

04:46.682 --> 04:47.932
My mom told me

04:48.162 --> 04:48.971
that the students
he is teaching now are about to

04:48.972 --> 04:50.211
take the senior high school
entrance examination,

04:50.212 --> 04:51.812
and told me not to even think about it.

04:53.042 --> 04:55.161
All members of your family are so funny.

04:55.162 --> 04:56.612
Just my mom.

05:00.282 --> 05:02.241
Qin is running a grocery store

05:02.242 --> 05:03.681
which hasn't got much business.

05:03.682 --> 05:05.852
I guess her business
won't last long.

05:06.162 --> 05:10.851
Besides, the boy she likes,
doesn't have a decent job.

05:10.852 --> 05:13.451
Her parents must
be worried about her.

05:13.452 --> 05:15.202
There's no use being worried.

05:15.362 --> 05:18.091
Parents can't make the decision
for their children.

05:18.092 --> 05:21.492
Qin's dad asked about
Xiaxia the other day.

05:22.602 --> 05:24.041
Why did he ask about Xiaxia?

05:24.042 --> 05:25.531
He's satisfied with Xiaxia,

05:25.532 --> 05:27.002
thinking that he has good skills.

05:27.122 --> 05:28.281
Is he truly satisfied with Xiaxia?

05:28.282 --> 05:30.122
He thought our family was poor two years ago.

05:30.282 --> 05:31.771
That was two years ago.

05:31.772 --> 05:32.971
Now is different.

05:32.972 --> 05:35.681
Xiaxia has learned the craft,
and we all know him well.

05:35.682 --> 05:36.451
Right?

05:36.452 --> 05:37.092
Then if there is a good girl,

05:37.093 --> 05:39.202
we must introduce her to Xiaxia at once.

05:39.412 --> 05:40.681
Xiaxia is still young.

05:40.682 --> 05:42.372
We should consider Yao first.

05:43.162 --> 05:46.451
We don't need to worry about Yao

05:46.452 --> 05:48.052
since Xiaochun is making efforts.

05:48.452 --> 05:51.451
I heard that Xiaochun
knew a female owner

05:51.452 --> 05:55.252
of a restaurant in town
who looks beautiful.

05:56.162 --> 05:57.882
Is she going to introduce that girl to Yao?

05:58.602 --> 06:00.361
Aunt Gui, don't just chat.

06:00.362 --> 06:01.522
Play mahjong.

06:04.122 --> 06:05.242
Three characters.

06:06.242 --> 06:08.412
Xiaochun talked about it at home.

06:08.682 --> 06:10.612
Yao, what do you think?

06:10.722 --> 06:12.161
No.

06:12.162 --> 06:15.681
I already told her not to do this,
and focus on her job.

06:15.682 --> 06:17.801
Is going to meet that girl a problem?

06:17.802 --> 06:18.628
That's not what I meant.

06:18.652 --> 06:21.571
Can this Xiaochun
put her mind on work?

06:21.572 --> 06:22.851
She is so busy with her work all day long.

06:22.852 --> 06:24.531
Why does she have the time
to think about trivial things.

06:24.532 --> 06:26.041
This is an important matter.

06:26.042 --> 06:26.801
Right?

06:26.802 --> 06:27.922
Exactly.

06:29.042 --> 06:30.162
Auntie,

06:30.282 --> 06:31.522
you need to reason with him.

06:31.802 --> 06:33.161
If you wanna reason with him,
just do it yourself.

06:33.162 --> 06:34.891
I can't do it.

06:34.892 --> 06:37.202
He has informed me

06:37.652 --> 06:40.932
to understand the situation
and give up illusions.

06:41.162 --> 06:43.642
What is "to understand the
situation and give up illusions"?

06:46.602 --> 06:48.252
Why did you kick me?

06:48.682 --> 06:50.122
I... I have long legs.

06:51.892 --> 06:53.322
Don't look at my tiles.

06:58.532 --> 06:59.481
We're like a bunch of

06:59.482 --> 07:01.091
back-seat drivers, giving unwanted advice.

07:01.092 --> 07:03.122
But Yao didn't even care about it.

07:04.282 --> 07:05.402
Hongdou,

07:05.852 --> 07:07.412
what do you think about Yao?

07:07.532 --> 07:08.682
He's nice.

07:09.212 --> 07:12.052
I'm asking if he's your type.

07:13.012 --> 07:14.132
No.

07:15.042 --> 07:16.481
Why?

07:16.482 --> 07:18.682
I prefer a lighter skin tone.

07:21.162 --> 07:22.411
Don't peek at my tiles.

07:22.412 --> 07:23.532
I didn't.

07:49.972 --> 07:51.412
Xiaochun, we're here.

07:55.362 --> 07:56.482
Hongdou.

07:57.922 --> 07:59.252
You...

07:59.412 --> 08:00.532
Why are you here?

08:01.122 --> 08:02.451
Didn't you ask Hongdou for dinner?

08:02.452 --> 08:03.451
I happened to be in the neighborhood

08:03.452 --> 08:04.762
so I came to eat together.

08:07.722 --> 08:08.842
What's wrong?

08:09.012 --> 08:09.971
Is there anything that you're gonna tell her

08:09.972 --> 08:10.772
but can't be known by me?

08:10.772 --> 08:11.892
Well,

08:13.242 --> 08:14.721
we're having a girls' talk.

08:14.722 --> 08:16.041
Don't be a meddler.

08:16.042 --> 08:16.851
Go back to the store.

08:16.852 --> 08:18.681
Let Nana make a
potato pancake for you.

08:18.682 --> 08:20.361
Are you really gona shoo me away?

08:20.362 --> 08:21.482
Xiaochun,

08:22.042 --> 08:23.851
Why are you standing at the door?

08:23.852 --> 08:25.091
I'm coming.

08:25.092 --> 08:26.212
Hurry.

08:27.092 --> 08:28.212
Well,

08:29.122 --> 08:30.811
come with us if you want.

08:30.812 --> 08:31.932
Let's go, Hongdou.

08:32.092 --> 08:32.452
What?

08:32.452 --> 08:32.882
Let's go.

08:32.883 --> 08:34.761
Xie Xiaochun, mind your attitude!

08:34.762 --> 08:36.291
Let me introduce her to you.

08:36.292 --> 08:38.521
This is the owner of the store.

08:38.522 --> 08:41.851
Wei, this is a good friend of mine,
Xu Hongdou.

08:41.852 --> 08:42.362
Nice to meet you.

08:42.362 --> 08:43.492
Nice to meet you, too.

08:45.292 --> 08:47.972
This is my brother, Xie Zhiyao.

08:48.122 --> 08:49.242
Glad to meet you.

08:50.292 --> 08:51.412
Mr. Xie,

08:52.122 --> 08:54.402
you have time to
come over today?

08:59.762 --> 09:00.761
Yes.

09:00.762 --> 09:02.402
He's free today.

09:02.522 --> 09:03.971
Then let's go sit in the yard

09:03.972 --> 09:04.722
so that it's more convenient to chat.

09:04.722 --> 09:05.362
Okay.

09:05.362 --> 09:06.122
Let's go.

09:06.122 --> 09:07.242
Let's go, Hongdou.

09:11.172 --> 09:12.211
Feel free to order.

09:12.212 --> 09:13.642
Be my guest.

09:13.812 --> 09:15.571
Lunch is on me today.

09:15.572 --> 09:17.451
I've been talking about
inviting Xiaochun to dinner.

09:17.452 --> 09:18.572
But she's been busy.

09:19.362 --> 09:22.051
I can't let you pay
for this meal today.

09:22.052 --> 09:23.361
Hongdou has been here for so long

09:23.362 --> 09:24.571
and she will soon be leaving,

09:24.572 --> 09:26.881
but I haven't even treated her once.

09:26.882 --> 09:29.042
So I should pay for the meal.

09:30.932 --> 09:33.001
Hongdou doesn't work here?

09:33.002 --> 09:34.291
No, I don't.

09:34.292 --> 09:36.171
I'm here for a vacation in Mr. Xie's yard.

09:36.172 --> 09:37.692
I'm a tenant.

09:39.972 --> 09:42.601
So this is a farewell meal today?

09:42.602 --> 09:44.121
Is it appropriate for me to stay here?

09:44.122 --> 09:45.241
Yes. It's totally fine.

09:45.242 --> 09:47.282
Just a meal. Don't worry.

09:48.052 --> 09:49.361
Then I'll buy you all a drink.

09:49.362 --> 09:51.451
I have a nice bottle of red wine here.

09:51.452 --> 09:52.521
Let's open it today.

09:52.522 --> 09:53.291
I'll go get it.

09:53.292 --> 09:54.121
No, no!

09:54.122 --> 09:55.612
Wei, you don't have to!

09:59.642 --> 10:02.332
She is such a born socializer, isn't she?

10:05.052 --> 10:06.172
Hey, brother

10:06.482 --> 10:09.452
did you not remember
anything I said to you before?

10:09.762 --> 10:10.882
What?

10:11.362 --> 10:13.051
Didn't I tell you about Sun Xiaowei,

10:13.052 --> 10:14.881
the owner of Fusion Cuisine Restaurant?

10:14.882 --> 10:16.282
And I planned to introduce her to you.

10:21.212 --> 10:22.522
He refused.

10:22.762 --> 10:25.001
But I couldn't tell her like that.

10:25.002 --> 10:26.361
I told her that you
didn't have the time.

10:26.362 --> 10:28.452
When you're free you will definitely come.

10:31.762 --> 10:32.882
Why are you looking at me?

10:33.212 --> 10:34.481
I didn't ask you to come.

10:34.482 --> 10:35.882
You asked to come yourself.

10:38.052 --> 10:39.521
Then, I'll leave.

10:39.522 --> 10:40.762
Why are you leaving now?

10:41.002 --> 10:42.252
I let you go just now,

10:42.692 --> 10:43.812
but you didn't.

10:45.572 --> 10:47.092
Are we ready to order?

10:48.722 --> 10:54.762
Well, I'll get a burger and a salami pancake,
okay?

10:55.172 --> 10:56.601
- What about you, Hongdou?
- A chicken burrito.

10:56.602 --> 10:57.722
Sure.

10:59.572 --> 11:00.692
I...

11:01.242 --> 11:02.492
I'm okay with anything.

11:03.602 --> 11:04.121
Okay.

11:04.122 --> 11:05.691
Please wait a moment. I'll inform the kitchen.

11:05.692 --> 11:06.812
Okay.

11:17.292 --> 11:18.241
Cheers!

11:18.242 --> 11:19.051
What a happy day.

11:19.052 --> 11:20.172
Indeed.

11:24.242 --> 11:26.851
Earlier Xiaochun said that
Mr. Xie hasn't got the time.

11:26.852 --> 11:27.482
I was thinking about

11:27.483 --> 11:29.452
going to Mr. Xie's stable to ride a horse.

11:29.722 --> 11:32.922
But my place was
just open so I didn't go.

11:33.522 --> 11:34.642
We're all busy.

11:35.292 --> 11:38.241
If you ask our neighbors about Mr. Xie,
they all know that

11:38.242 --> 11:40.881
he is a successful
businessman and a good-looking

11:40.882 --> 11:42.691
and warm-hearted person.

11:42.692 --> 11:44.121
I'm so flattered.

11:44.122 --> 11:45.481
Don't listen to their nonsense.

11:45.482 --> 11:47.121
This is not nonsense.

11:47.122 --> 11:49.572
You're indeed handsome
as far as I'm concerned.

11:50.292 --> 11:52.852
But,
How come you don't have a girlfriend?

11:53.452 --> 11:55.761
Well,
my brother is an unrecognized eligible bachelor

11:55.762 --> 11:57.521
who has been devoted to his career.

11:57.522 --> 11:58.642
Unrecognized eligible bachelor.

12:03.972 --> 12:06.402
I thought so too at first.

12:07.092 --> 12:09.721
Later,
I found out that he was actually not.

12:09.722 --> 12:11.282
He's got a high standard of choosing a spouse.

12:11.602 --> 12:13.361
He's patient with finding the best match,

12:13.362 --> 12:15.042
unlike some other men

12:15.212 --> 12:17.691
who has a wife but
still looks for mistresses.

12:17.692 --> 12:18.812
He's not like that.

12:22.362 --> 12:23.691
I'm not that noble.

12:23.692 --> 12:25.282
It's just that nobody likes me.

12:27.932 --> 12:28.572
Let's not talk about it.

12:28.572 --> 12:29.122
Come on.

12:29.123 --> 12:30.051
Bottoms up!

12:30.052 --> 12:30.482
Come on!

12:30.483 --> 12:31.361
Cheers!

12:31.362 --> 12:32.091
Bottoms up?

12:32.092 --> 12:33.212
Bottoms up!

12:50.692 --> 12:52.762
Why didn't you say something for me?

12:54.092 --> 12:55.851
I've said everything for you.

12:55.852 --> 12:57.522
All I said about you was compliments.

12:57.692 --> 12:59.042
I said you're righteous

12:59.242 --> 13:00.362
and filial.

13:01.722 --> 13:04.361
Are you helping me or are
you helping me find a match?

13:04.362 --> 13:08.002
Wei thought you were
here for a blind date.

13:08.362 --> 13:10.001
But you shouldn't go along with what she said.

13:10.002 --> 13:11.601
I tried my best to get away
with the blind-date topic

13:11.602 --> 13:13.002
but you just brought it back again.

13:13.762 --> 13:15.521
Well,
what Wei asked is not a big deal.

13:15.522 --> 13:17.811
But since she asked me,
I had to answer.

13:17.812 --> 13:19.051
Great.

13:19.052 --> 13:19.692
Now she thought

13:19.693 --> 13:21.121
I was so eager to be on a blind date with her,

13:21.122 --> 13:22.972
and I found myself
two silver-tongued helpers with me.

13:24.972 --> 13:26.641
What Xiaochun did is enough.

13:26.642 --> 13:27.762
And you!

13:29.882 --> 13:31.091
Do you want me to find a date so badly?

13:31.092 --> 13:32.212
Do you?

13:34.242 --> 13:35.098
No.

13:35.122 --> 13:36.762
That's not what I meant.

13:45.642 --> 13:47.642
Why is Xiaochun so slow?

13:50.242 --> 13:51.121
I still have something to do.

13:51.122 --> 13:52.402
I can't wait any longer. Gotta go.

13:52.972 --> 13:54.092
Okay.

14:04.362 --> 14:05.612
Thank you.

14:05.812 --> 14:06.932
Hongdou.

14:08.452 --> 14:09.451
Where's Yao?

14:09.452 --> 14:10.882
He's left for work.

14:11.002 --> 14:12.762
Why did he leave so soon?

14:14.482 --> 14:15.691
I'm so sorry.

14:15.692 --> 14:17.291
I thought the ambiance of this restaurant
is quite good

14:17.292 --> 14:18.521
so I brought you here.

14:18.522 --> 14:19.122
I didn't expect...

14:19.123 --> 14:21.002
The dishes are great.

14:21.812 --> 14:22.811
Where are you going?

14:22.812 --> 14:23.811
I'm going back to the warehouse.

14:23.812 --> 14:24.571
And you?

14:24.572 --> 14:25.811
I'll go to visit Granny Xie.

14:25.812 --> 14:27.282
Then let's go together.

14:32.762 --> 14:33.972
Have you eaten?

14:34.882 --> 14:36.002
Yes.

14:37.052 --> 14:38.332
And I feel sleepy.

14:40.362 --> 14:41.482
Come.

14:44.172 --> 14:45.292
Sit here.

14:59.362 --> 15:00.612
What's the sigh?

15:01.172 --> 15:02.762
What's bothering you?

15:04.522 --> 15:06.092
My mind is a little bit confused.

15:07.362 --> 15:08.972
You've thought too much.

15:09.482 --> 15:12.922
The more you think about it,
the more troublesome it is.

15:16.002 --> 15:17.122
Granny,

15:17.452 --> 15:21.522
I wonder why a
person can't be exactly

15:22.242 --> 15:24.572
what you want them to be?

15:24.882 --> 15:26.452
Why can't you have all you want in him?

15:28.242 --> 15:30.372
You can't be so greedy.

15:30.812 --> 15:32.931
When you have a thousand bucks,
you want ten thousand.

15:32.932 --> 15:35.972
When you become an emperor,
you want to be god.

15:36.402 --> 15:38.241
A man only has two hands.

15:38.242 --> 15:41.001
No matter how much fortune is in front of you,

15:41.002 --> 15:43.372
you only have two hands to hold them.

15:43.692 --> 15:45.291
If you take a gold bracelet
and a silver bracelet,

15:45.292 --> 15:47.282
you won't be able to take a jade bracelet.

15:47.482 --> 15:50.122
How can you have
anything you want?

15:53.122 --> 15:55.212
We can't have everything we want.

15:56.002 --> 15:57.122
I got it.

15:58.812 --> 16:00.162
When will you leave?

16:00.452 --> 16:01.572
In a few days.

16:03.122 --> 16:05.691
Then come here for
meal a few more times.

16:05.692 --> 16:06.812
I'd love to.

16:08.402 --> 16:09.522
Granny,

16:09.642 --> 16:10.762
I think

16:10.882 --> 16:13.282
you smell like my grandma.

16:14.572 --> 16:15.692
What do I smell like?

16:16.362 --> 16:17.922
The smell of baking bread.

16:21.292 --> 16:23.762
That's the smell of burning firewood.

16:28.362 --> 16:29.482
Granny,

16:29.932 --> 16:31.852
you must stay healthy!

16:32.482 --> 16:34.402
You need to listen to Yao.

16:35.212 --> 16:36.852
Remember to go to the hospital if you feel sick.

16:36.972 --> 16:38.572
Don't refuse to see a doctor
because you don't wanna bother others.

16:40.002 --> 16:41.122
I got it.

16:42.052 --> 16:45.092
I also want to tell
you a few words.

16:45.692 --> 16:48.042
Don't take things too seriously

16:48.762 --> 16:50.092
but relax.

16:50.972 --> 16:53.372
The more you worry,
the more troubles will arise.

16:54.242 --> 16:55.642
Everything will be fine.

17:00.012 --> 17:01.252
I remember.

17:10.292 --> 17:13.191
♫ Stars in the sky ♫

17:13.192 --> 17:16.071
♫ I pick some mushrooms. ♫

17:16.072 --> 17:18.791
♫ Mushrooms can fill the basket. ♫

17:18.792 --> 17:21.671
♫ I take out a pen. ♫

17:21.672 --> 17:24.551
♫ The pen leaks ink. ♫

17:24.552 --> 17:27.401
♫ What can I do? ♫

17:27.402 --> 17:31.512
♫ I have piles of mung beans ♫

17:35.852 --> 17:38.651
♫ Mung beans are delicious. ♫

17:38.652 --> 17:41.351
♫ Gingers are tender. ♫

17:41.352 --> 17:44.231
♫ Tender gingers taste pungent. ♫

17:44.232 --> 17:47.151
♫ They pile up like a tower, ♫

17:47.152 --> 17:49.791
♫ And the tower is tall. ♫

17:49.792 --> 17:52.831
♫ With a slim figure. ♫

17:52.832 --> 17:57.252
♫ My baby, let's go to sleep. ♫

18:01.152 --> 18:04.011
♫ And the tower is tall. ♫

18:04.012 --> 18:06.831
♫ With a slim figure. ♫

18:06.832 --> 18:12.392
♫ My baby, let's go to sleep. ♫

18:15.252 --> 18:18.071
♫ Stars in the sky ♫

18:18.072 --> 18:20.951
♫ I pick some mushrooms. ♫

18:20.952 --> 18:23.851
♫ Mushrooms can fill the basket. ♫

18:23.852 --> 18:26.851
♫ I take out a pen. ♫

18:26.852 --> 18:29.591
♫ The pen leaks ink. ♫

18:29.592 --> 18:32.391
♫ What can I do? ♫

18:32.392 --> 18:36.712
♫ I have piles of mung beans ♫

18:40.832 --> 18:43.631
♫ Mung beans are delicious. ♫

18:43.632 --> 18:46.311
♫ Gingers are tender. ♫

18:46.312 --> 18:49.251
♫ Tender gingers taste pungent. ♫

18:49.252 --> 18:52.031
♫ They pile up like a tower, ♫

18:52.032 --> 18:54.871
♫ And the tower is tall. ♫

18:54.872 --> 18:57.751
♫ With a slim figure. ♫

18:57.752 --> 19:02.352
♫ My baby, let's go to sleep. ♫

19:06.152 --> 19:08.911
♫ And the tower is tall. ♫

19:08.912 --> 19:11.851
♫ With a slim figure. ♫

19:11.852 --> 19:16.792
♫ My baby, let's go to sleep. ♫

19:17.552 --> 19:24.152
♫ My baby, let's go to sleep. ♫

19:44.882 --> 19:45.961
Hello, Nana.

19:45.962 --> 19:47.082
What's wrong?

19:47.532 --> 19:48.401
Mr. Xie,

19:48.402 --> 19:49.961
Hongdou had a fever
and got an IV drip this afternoon.

19:49.962 --> 19:50.881
She hasn't come back yet.

19:50.882 --> 19:52.652
Do you have time to pick her up?

19:53.532 --> 19:54.652
I'll go right away.

19:54.712 --> 19:57.851
♫ A feeling rushing out to me ♫

19:57.852 --> 20:01.992
♫ spills my heart into the field ♫

20:02.352 --> 20:08.951
♫ I know it. I will be yours. ♫

20:08.952 --> 20:15.531
♫ Would you ask for any horse
but this one inside your heart? ♫

20:15.532 --> 20:16.652
You...

20:17.162 --> 20:19.212
You don't usually exercise, do you?

20:20.202 --> 20:21.492
I don't exercise?

20:22.162 --> 20:23.892
Why do you make me worried all day long?

20:27.922 --> 20:28.881
Gosh.

20:28.882 --> 20:30.441
What happened?

20:30.442 --> 20:31.251
Why didn't you tell me that

20:31.252 --> 20:32.452
you got a fever and needed to get an IV drip.

20:34.402 --> 20:35.851
Just an IV drip.

20:35.852 --> 20:37.282
Why should I tell you?

20:38.572 --> 20:40.362
You shouldn't come alone.

20:41.772 --> 20:43.562
I always went to the hospital alone
when I was in Beijing.

20:45.362 --> 20:46.732
Are we in Beijing?

20:50.852 --> 20:53.082
Weren't you angry with me this afternoon?

20:53.492 --> 20:54.252
No matter I was angry or not,

20:54.253 --> 20:55.842
I won't leave you alone like this.

21:00.162 --> 21:01.932
It's not a serious disease.

21:02.092 --> 21:03.362
I'm not that fragile.

21:04.402 --> 21:06.212
I think you have lost your mind.

21:06.602 --> 21:07.722
Look what time it is now.

21:08.092 --> 21:09.322
When your IV is done,

21:09.772 --> 21:10.601
it will be pitch dark outside.

21:10.602 --> 21:11.892
Won't you be scared?

21:13.162 --> 21:14.842
I've told Hu.

21:15.012 --> 21:17.161
He'll come to pick me up
after he finished his work

21:17.162 --> 21:18.892
in the downtown bar.

21:21.092 --> 21:23.762
You really know
how to piss me off.

21:24.852 --> 21:25.572
What's wrong with me?

21:25.573 --> 21:27.132
How can I piss you off?

21:28.602 --> 21:37.632
♫ I'll give you the saddle of my heart. ♫

21:40.572 --> 21:41.842
Never mind.

21:42.202 --> 21:43.562
You're sick.

21:43.812 --> 21:45.692
I won't make a
fuss with a patient.

21:48.252 --> 21:49.372
Cephalosporin?

21:50.532 --> 21:51.571
The fever was caused by bacterial infection.

21:51.572 --> 21:52.892
I need to get drips for three days.

22:02.532 --> 22:03.652
My fever is gone.

22:06.012 --> 22:07.132
Are you hungry?

22:08.572 --> 22:09.692
No.

22:10.362 --> 22:11.468
Well,

22:11.492 --> 22:12.601
just sit down.

22:12.602 --> 22:15.562
Don't stand in front
of me like a pillar.

22:41.642 --> 22:44.002
I... I'm sorry

22:45.442 --> 22:46.562
for this afternoon.

22:47.362 --> 22:49.161
I didn't mean to do that.

22:49.162 --> 22:50.282
Don't be angry.

22:52.092 --> 22:53.362
Why did you apologize?

22:53.732 --> 22:55.172
It's me who should apologize.

22:55.682 --> 22:57.492
I don't know what's wrong with me.

22:59.962 --> 23:01.802
But Wei is indeed

23:02.092 --> 23:03.602
a pretty woman.

23:06.442 --> 23:08.051
You should spend more time with her.

23:08.052 --> 23:09.201
Perhaps you two can...

23:09.202 --> 23:10.322
You know it.

23:12.052 --> 23:13.172
She's a beauty.

23:23.602 --> 23:24.762
Right?

23:27.162 --> 23:28.282
What

23:28.732 --> 23:30.492
is the smell?

23:31.812 --> 23:33.252
The smell of disinfectant?

23:38.402 --> 23:39.732
The smell of jealousy.

23:41.852 --> 23:43.452
What's your problem?

23:46.012 --> 23:47.132
Give me your hand.

23:49.402 --> 23:50.522
Why?

23:54.572 --> 23:56.042
Read your palm.

23:56.492 --> 23:57.612
Screw you.

23:58.352 --> 24:01.252
♫ A rainbow is ahead of the road. ♫

24:02.932 --> 24:06.052
♫ We miss the chance to embrace each other. ♫

24:09.882 --> 24:11.002
Are you cold?

24:11.312 --> 24:14.312
♫ Where does true love hide? ♫

24:16.052 --> 24:19.032
♫ Whose dream will it slip into? ♫

24:19.442 --> 24:25.251
♫ In the street where the rain or sun falls, ♫

24:25.252 --> 24:26.372
Here.

24:27.202 --> 24:29.082
I added two eggs in it for you.

24:29.202 --> 24:30.011
You don't have to eat all of the noodles,

24:30.012 --> 24:31.132
but you need to eat the eggs.

24:33.162 --> 24:34.492
This is too much.

24:34.682 --> 24:36.492
I... I'll give you some.

24:36.732 --> 24:37.601
It isn't that much.

24:37.602 --> 24:39.132
You eat first.
Then leave it to me if you can't finish.

24:40.572 --> 24:42.002
This is indeed too much.

24:42.852 --> 24:44.042
Go get a bowl.

24:45.572 --> 24:46.508
Okay then.

24:46.532 --> 24:50.712
♫ Sometimes I find I fall in love. ♫

24:51.402 --> 24:55.232
♫ Make a little wish and pray. ♫

24:55.602 --> 25:00.272
♫ Maybe it will work out
the way you want it to. ♫

25:06.732 --> 25:08.601
I'll help you eat some noodles.

25:08.602 --> 25:09.972
You have to eat the eggs yourself.

25:15.092 --> 25:17.212
I'll go get you a hot cup of tea.

25:25.812 --> 25:27.362
What is

25:28.162 --> 25:30.282
going on here?

25:33.682 --> 25:35.602
What can happen between
a man and a woman?

25:37.922 --> 25:39.132
Do you think

25:40.202 --> 25:41.932
they're dating?

25:43.442 --> 25:46.491
Damai said Everything
that happens now

25:46.492 --> 25:49.892
will be flashbacks in the future.

25:50.772 --> 25:52.602
Flashbacks?

25:55.052 --> 25:57.602
You don't understand?

26:00.362 --> 26:01.732
I'll go to write my songs.

26:08.252 --> 26:09.372
Potato, potato.

26:16.962 --> 26:18.282
I'm sweet potato.
(A funny code name to establish contact)

26:18.572 --> 26:20.252
Stupid gag.

27:00.642 --> 27:01.892
Hello, Xiaochun.

27:02.442 --> 27:03.732
I'm at home.

27:04.402 --> 27:05.762
She's here?

27:06.442 --> 27:07.652
Okay, I'll go downstairs and pick her up.

27:20.052 --> 27:21.138
Hongdou.

27:21.162 --> 27:22.011
Miss, please go with her.

27:22.012 --> 27:22.601
Okay.

27:22.602 --> 27:24.571
Hello, how was your trip?

27:24.572 --> 27:25.331
Good.

27:25.332 --> 27:26.441
Xiaochun went to unload the goods.

27:26.442 --> 27:27.291
She'll come over when she's done.

27:27.292 --> 27:28.291
I'll show you to your room first.

27:28.292 --> 27:29.602
Okay, thank you.

27:30.602 --> 27:31.201
Luggage.

27:31.202 --> 27:32.268
Give it to me.

27:32.292 --> 27:32.881
The handle.

27:32.882 --> 27:34.002
Okay.

27:35.332 --> 27:36.692
I heard you had a fever
and got an IV drip yesterday.

27:37.442 --> 27:38.961
I'm fine now. Thank you.

27:38.962 --> 27:40.082
Then I should get going.

27:40.772 --> 27:41.092
This way.

27:41.092 --> 27:42.212
Thank you.

27:46.642 --> 27:49.851
It's morning now so everyone
is busy with their work.

27:49.852 --> 27:50.572
We'll give you a welcome party

27:50.573 --> 27:51.972
this evening when everyone is back.

27:52.252 --> 27:53.771
You don't have to.

27:53.772 --> 27:54.331
It's fine.

27:54.332 --> 27:55.762
This is the new tradition of the yard.

27:56.012 --> 27:56.921
Your room is on the second floor.

27:56.922 --> 27:58.932
Be careful. The stairs are a bit steep.

27:59.332 --> 28:00.641
Is it too heavy for you?

28:00.642 --> 28:01.052
Let me help you.

28:01.052 --> 28:01.731
It's nothing.

28:01.732 --> 28:02.932
It's not that heavy.

28:06.922 --> 28:08.452
Watch your steps. The stairs are narrow.

28:14.922 --> 28:16.732
The yard is quite large.

28:18.012 --> 28:20.051
The yard is not
a public property.

28:20.052 --> 28:22.082
It's combined by three independent houses.

28:22.202 --> 28:24.492
Originally,
the place was rented out as an inn.

28:24.732 --> 28:26.002
But it went out of business,

28:26.252 --> 28:27.652
and has been idle for three years.

28:28.052 --> 28:29.961
Later, Mr. Xie found a designer

28:29.962 --> 28:31.322
to renovate the whole place again

28:31.442 --> 28:32.562
and used it for short-term rentals.

28:32.772 --> 28:34.331
There are six rooms here.

28:34.332 --> 28:36.212
The public area is over there downstairs.

28:36.962 --> 28:38.492
Let me show you the room.

28:38.922 --> 28:40.042
Okay.

28:42.162 --> 28:43.282
Here.

28:45.922 --> 28:47.851
Your room was cleaned
up by the housekeeper

28:47.852 --> 28:49.492
before you came.

28:49.772 --> 28:50.972
Windows were opened for fresh air.

28:51.492 --> 28:53.201
All the electrical appliances
have been checked

28:53.202 --> 28:54.322
and there are no problems.

28:55.162 --> 28:57.851
However,
she is only responsible for

28:57.852 --> 28:59.441
the cleaning of public areas.

28:59.442 --> 29:01.641
You may have to
clean the room yourself.

29:01.642 --> 29:03.201
If you want the housekeeper
to clean it up for you,

29:03.202 --> 29:04.562
you'll have to pay some extra money.

29:04.812 --> 29:05.932
Got it.

29:06.532 --> 29:06.812
By the way,

29:06.813 --> 29:08.601
there is a big temperature difference
between morning and night,

29:08.602 --> 29:10.361
and there are many mosquitoes at night.

29:10.362 --> 29:11.531
I'll get you the pesticide later.

29:11.532 --> 29:12.051
You can spray it in your room.

29:12.052 --> 29:13.161
I have it in my room.

29:13.162 --> 29:14.201
You don't need to buy it.

29:14.202 --> 29:15.842
Thank you so much, Anytime.

29:16.052 --> 29:17.571
Are you also the housekeeper here?

29:17.572 --> 29:19.251
No, I'm not.

29:19.252 --> 29:20.921
I'm the tenant next door.

29:20.922 --> 29:22.132
I'm just doing a favor.

29:22.882 --> 29:23.961
You're a tenant as well?

29:23.962 --> 29:25.082
Yes.

29:25.162 --> 29:26.731
If you don't say you're a tenant,
I thought

29:26.732 --> 29:28.562
you'd been living here for a long time.

29:29.052 --> 29:30.172
Why?

29:30.402 --> 29:32.652
The vibe between you and the yard
seems harmonious.

29:34.092 --> 29:35.401
I'm leaving in a couple of days.

29:35.402 --> 29:36.531
But I'm still here these two days.

29:36.532 --> 29:38.002
If you need anything, just ask me.

29:39.252 --> 29:41.212
What a pity.

29:41.492 --> 29:43.132
I just got here but you're leaving.

29:43.732 --> 29:45.362
But our meeting here
is the result of serendipity.

29:46.532 --> 29:47.652
You're right.

29:48.162 --> 29:49.921
Let me introduce myself.

29:49.922 --> 29:51.322
My name is Bai Manjun.

29:51.882 --> 29:53.732
You can call me Manjun.

29:53.962 --> 29:54.811
Manjun.

29:54.812 --> 29:55.531
Xu Hongdou.

29:55.532 --> 29:56.091
Glad to meet you.

29:56.092 --> 29:57.212
Glad to meet you, too.

29:57.442 --> 29:59.091
Then you can unpack your luggage.

29:59.092 --> 29:59.921
Xiaochun will come later.

29:59.922 --> 30:01.842
She said she wanted to have lunch with you.

30:01.962 --> 30:03.082
Okay.

30:03.162 --> 30:04.331
Feel free to call me if you need anything.

30:04.332 --> 30:05.011
Sure.

30:05.012 --> 30:05.961
Thanks a lot.

30:05.962 --> 30:07.082
It's nothing.

30:16.532 --> 30:17.652
Xu Hongdolu.

30:19.052 --> 30:20.212
How are you feeling?

30:20.332 --> 30:21.562
I'm fine.

30:22.492 --> 30:23.771
When do I need to get the IV drip?

30:23.772 --> 30:24.858
Four o'clock.

30:24.882 --> 30:26.042
I'll go with you.

30:26.642 --> 30:27.762
Okay.

30:41.572 --> 30:42.548
Hongdou,

30:42.572 --> 30:43.771
Why did you come back by yourself?

30:43.772 --> 30:44.892
Where's Mr. Xie?

30:45.202 --> 30:46.251
Xinxin just called.

30:46.252 --> 30:47.491
She told him to go to the village committee

30:47.492 --> 30:49.602
to mediate between the villagers.

30:50.362 --> 30:52.212
Wait a moment.

30:53.202 --> 30:54.492
It's you who went to pick up the new tenant.

30:55.532 --> 30:56.932
Is she pretty?

30:58.442 --> 30:59.441
How about this?

30:59.442 --> 31:01.091
Since you know her,

31:01.092 --> 31:02.811
you go upstairs and tell her to come down later.

31:02.812 --> 31:03.932
I'll just sit here

31:04.012 --> 31:05.921
and play the guitar with my back to her,
creating

31:05.922 --> 31:08.291
a sense of mystique.

31:08.292 --> 31:09.011
Okay?

31:09.012 --> 31:09.731
Okay.

31:09.732 --> 31:10.052
Thank you.

31:10.052 --> 31:10.938
I'll go tell her.

31:10.962 --> 31:12.082
Relax.

31:12.532 --> 31:13.802
Don't be nervous.

31:28.012 --> 31:29.692
How do I look?

31:34.962 --> 31:36.132
Manjun,

31:38.772 --> 31:39.442
are you free at the moment?

31:39.443 --> 31:40.531
Let's go downstairs and take a break.

31:40.532 --> 31:41.652
Sure.

31:41.732 --> 31:42.811
Are you done tidying up your luggage?

31:42.812 --> 31:43.442
Yes.

31:43.442 --> 31:44.562
I don't have many stuffs.

31:44.602 --> 31:45.811
You go downstairs first.

31:45.812 --> 31:47.051
I'll go change my clothes.

31:47.052 --> 31:48.172
Okay.

32:00.092 --> 32:00.882
She's coming, Hu.

32:00.882 --> 32:02.042
Get ready!

32:04.442 --> 32:06.201
♫ The afternoon breeze is sweet, ♫

32:06.202 --> 32:08.692
♫ blowing into a new season. ♫

32:09.642 --> 32:11.771
♫ Your beautiful smile ♫

32:11.772 --> 32:13.842
♫ is so pure and innocent. ♫

32:14.812 --> 32:17.172
♫ Sometimes you're in a bad mood, ♫

32:17.492 --> 32:19.562
♫ and I'm your comfort. ♫

32:19.812 --> 32:23.252
♫ I wish happiness can always be with you. ♫

32:25.532 --> 32:27.322
It is still the same song.

32:29.292 --> 32:30.602
You are?

32:42.602 --> 32:43.722
Sir,

32:43.812 --> 32:45.091
a double expresso, please.

32:45.092 --> 32:46.252
Thank you.

33:11.092 --> 33:15.531
♫ Meeting you is like a bamboo forest
meeting early summer ♫

33:15.532 --> 33:18.091
♫ and birds meeting the waves. ♫

33:18.092 --> 33:20.762
♫ With you,
I'll never get lost in my adventure. ♫

33:22.092 --> 33:24.652
♫ With you, I'll never
get lost in my adventure. ♫

33:25.882 --> 33:28.452
♫ With you,
I'll never get lost in my adventure. ♫

33:28.602 --> 33:29.722
Go away!

33:29.852 --> 33:31.732
I'll just say a few words and then I'll go.

33:32.732 --> 33:34.042
Miss,

33:34.292 --> 33:36.562
whatever it is, it's gonna pass.

33:36.732 --> 33:39.881
If you are having a hard time now,
you should

33:39.882 --> 33:40.851
put the trouble aside for the moment.

33:40.852 --> 33:42.771
You will find that what's
bothering you right now

33:42.772 --> 33:45.732
will disappear itself
in the near future.

33:45.882 --> 33:47.681
Even if you're obsessed with it,

33:47.682 --> 33:49.331
it will finally... Thank you.

33:49.332 --> 33:50.602
Be bygones.

33:50.732 --> 33:52.562
That's all. Bye.

33:59.602 --> 34:00.722
Mom.

34:00.922 --> 34:02.042
What's wrong?

34:02.562 --> 34:03.921
I'm in Beijing.

34:03.922 --> 34:05.042
It's a music festival,

34:05.172 --> 34:05.922
not a bar.

34:05.922 --> 34:06.691
Music festival. Listen.

34:06.692 --> 34:07.882
Sir,

34:09.442 --> 34:10.521
get me another cup, please.

34:10.522 --> 34:10.882
Okay.

34:10.883 --> 34:12.081
I'll talk to you later.

34:12.082 --> 34:13.202
Bye.

34:17.252 --> 34:18.572
This is my coffee.

34:19.042 --> 34:19.978
Bye.

34:20.002 --> 34:21.122
You!

34:22.922 --> 34:24.042
Your cup.

34:26.772 --> 34:28.691
I'll buy you a drink.

34:28.692 --> 34:29.731
No. It's too late.

34:29.732 --> 34:30.852
I won't drink.

34:31.442 --> 34:32.611
It's so late now.

34:32.612 --> 34:35.282
Why do you drink
double espresso.

34:37.612 --> 34:38.732
Come on.

34:39.652 --> 34:41.012
Come talk with me.

34:44.562 --> 34:45.682
Alright.

34:45.882 --> 34:47.362
Although we don't know each other,

34:48.882 --> 34:50.762
since you're in a bad mood,

34:51.652 --> 34:53.331
just see me as a shoulder to cry on.

34:53.332 --> 34:55.362
Whatever you wanna say,
just talk to me.

34:55.652 --> 34:57.252
I'm okay. I can stand it.

34:59.562 --> 35:01.212
Let me show you something.

35:08.652 --> 35:09.882
Where's my bag?

35:21.042 --> 35:23.172
Divorce Certificate

35:23.612 --> 35:25.322
of the People's Republic of China.

35:26.852 --> 35:28.482
I've never even seen a marriage certificate yet,

35:28.612 --> 35:30.252
but now I see a divorce certificate.

35:30.612 --> 35:32.322
Don't they look the
same as each other?

35:33.002 --> 35:34.211
Almost.

35:34.212 --> 35:35.332
Almost.

35:36.212 --> 35:38.012
Seeing you like this...

35:38.562 --> 35:39.682
Did your husband,

35:41.252 --> 35:43.731
you ex-husband cheated on you?

35:43.732 --> 35:44.852
No.

35:45.562 --> 35:46.922
Then you cheated on him?

35:48.692 --> 35:50.802
I didn't have the time.

35:52.482 --> 35:54.401
I need to take care of my family,

35:54.402 --> 35:58.362
my daughter, my ex-husband,
and my mother-in-law.

35:58.962 --> 36:00.692
So you lived with your mother-in-law?

36:00.962 --> 36:02.851
You didn't get along well with her?

36:02.852 --> 36:03.972
No.

36:04.292 --> 36:05.881
My mother-in-law lives upstairs.

36:05.882 --> 36:07.252
She's very nice.

36:08.562 --> 36:11.291
I actually married my ex-husband

36:11.292 --> 36:14.442
because I thought my
mother-in-law was good.

36:15.652 --> 36:16.772
Then

36:16.922 --> 36:18.401
it's your ex who didn't treat you well.

36:18.402 --> 36:19.922
Then you should divorce.

36:20.522 --> 36:21.642
Not exactly.

36:21.772 --> 36:23.842
My mom and dad can't
pick anything wrong with him.

36:24.172 --> 36:25.442
Then why?

36:26.362 --> 36:28.291
Since they're all nice,
why did you divorce?

36:28.292 --> 36:30.012
I don't get it.

36:31.002 --> 36:32.442
You don't need to understand.

36:33.652 --> 36:34.772
Cheers.

36:34.852 --> 36:37.771
I mean... lady,
you shouldn't drink too much.

36:37.772 --> 36:39.171
Stop drinking.

36:39.172 --> 36:40.402
Cheers.

36:44.922 --> 36:46.042
Well,

36:46.292 --> 36:47.482
now that you divorced,

36:48.402 --> 36:49.522
you need to believe

36:49.562 --> 36:52.882
that you will have a
happy and bright future.

36:54.882 --> 36:56.002
Thank you.

36:56.432 --> 37:00.652
♫ I always aspire to be closer to the ideal. ♫

37:01.692 --> 37:06.842
♫ The more I long for it,
the more disoriented I become. ♫

37:07.092 --> 37:11.512
♫ You're in a mess, and I'm flurried. ♫

37:12.432 --> 37:18.191
♫ It is seeing everything,
but it doesn't tell anyone. ♫

37:18.192 --> 37:25.552
♫ Some stop, some wander as always. ♫

37:25.902 --> 37:31.041
♫ If life is a house,
then the days we spend in it are windows. ♫

37:31.042 --> 37:35.291
♫ The stories we want
are happening right next to us. ♫

37:35.292 --> 37:38.691
I saw her in a bad mood,
so I went up to persuade her

37:38.692 --> 37:40.572
from the force of habit.

37:40.692 --> 37:43.402
Thank you for not
treating me as a hooligan.

37:44.002 --> 37:48.012
Hu seems to be a little roguish,

37:48.172 --> 37:50.842
but in fact,
he is quite warm-hearted.

37:52.652 --> 37:56.651
I agree. He told me that if
I feel bad and want to relax

37:56.652 --> 37:58.882
for a while, I can come here

37:59.042 --> 38:00.611
because the people here are very nice.

38:00.612 --> 38:02.732
Yes. The people here are very nice.

38:02.922 --> 38:04.921
But I didn't expect that
you could really come.

38:04.922 --> 38:05.172
Right?

38:05.173 --> 38:07.001
You didn't even leave
me your phone number.

38:07.002 --> 38:08.692
I can search for this place online myself.

38:10.442 --> 38:11.562
Pity.

38:12.042 --> 38:15.081
You should tell Xiaochun
that you are my friend

38:15.082 --> 38:16.771
and I invited you to come here

38:16.772 --> 38:18.731
so that she can give you a discount on the rent.

38:18.732 --> 38:19.852
Really?

38:20.002 --> 38:22.521
Hu, you didn't get a discount

38:22.522 --> 38:24.052
on your own rent either, did you?

38:26.692 --> 38:29.172
You must have been an
excavator in a past life.

38:29.652 --> 38:30.922
All you know is sabotage.

38:31.172 --> 38:32.652
Manjun, eat some fruit.

38:34.402 --> 38:35.522
Thanks.

38:36.082 --> 38:37.171
Say that again!

38:37.172 --> 38:38.291
You stole my corns.

38:38.292 --> 38:38.692
Shame on you!

38:38.693 --> 38:40.322
Those belong to me!

38:40.922 --> 38:42.171
Don't fight!

38:42.172 --> 38:43.361
Don't fight here!

38:43.362 --> 38:44.882
Don't fight here!

38:45.522 --> 38:46.651
Stop!

38:46.652 --> 38:48.291
Stop fighting!

38:48.292 --> 38:49.412
Mister!

39:05.332 --> 39:07.282
What happened to you?

39:08.172 --> 39:09.361
The villagers were having a fight.

39:09.362 --> 39:10.441
I didn't have long hair for them to pull,

39:10.442 --> 39:11.962
so they ripped my clothes.

39:13.402 --> 39:15.001
You're scratched.

39:15.002 --> 39:16.122
Where?

39:16.172 --> 39:17.292
On your neck.

39:19.852 --> 39:21.442
You could get an infection.

39:21.732 --> 39:22.252
Come upstairs.

39:22.253 --> 39:23.732
Let me cleanse your wound with iodine.

39:25.362 --> 39:26.762
Then put it down.

39:28.692 --> 39:29.812
What?

39:29.922 --> 39:32.212
Put your hair down
so that I can climb up.

39:33.962 --> 39:35.282
Spin your own thread.

39:47.882 --> 39:49.002
Come in.

39:57.652 --> 39:59.092
Are you packing?

40:00.522 --> 40:01.252
Wait a second.

40:01.252 --> 40:02.442
I'm looking for iodine.

40:22.922 --> 40:24.282
Found it.

40:24.442 --> 40:25.692
Wait.

40:38.212 --> 40:39.332
Let me check.

40:40.732 --> 40:42.771
His nails are really sharp.

40:42.772 --> 40:45.081
If he scratched your face,
you'll be disfigured.

40:45.082 --> 40:46.842
You didn't see his nails in person.

40:47.082 --> 40:48.441
They've all turned brown because of smoking.

40:48.442 --> 40:50.132
And It's all black under the nails.

40:53.772 --> 40:55.441
Just cleanse the wound.

40:55.442 --> 40:56.611
Don't breathe on my neck.

40:56.612 --> 40:57.611
Sorry.

40:57.612 --> 40:59.092
I did that subconsciously.

41:15.252 --> 41:16.372
It's fine.

41:18.332 --> 41:19.452
Keep going.

41:20.252 --> 41:21.402
Keep going,

41:35.232 --> 41:42.072
♫ I've been alone into the unknown. ♫

41:42.242 --> 41:47.811
♫ Can navigate through the dark. ♫

41:47.812 --> 41:50.962
Be careful when you
go back and shower.

41:51.212 --> 41:52.612
Don't get water on the wound.

41:52.982 --> 41:56.592
♫ A meadow of mine ♫

41:58.252 --> 41:59.372
Then I should get going.

42:03.182 --> 42:06.472
♫ A feeling rushing out to me ♫

42:09.562 --> 42:10.682
By the way,

42:13.172 --> 42:14.331
don't stay up too late.

42:14.332 --> 42:15.452
Go to bed early.

42:16.362 --> 42:17.482
You too,

42:17.612 --> 42:18.732
Get some rest early.

42:25.482 --> 42:34.392
♫ I'll give you the saddle of my heart. ♫

42:46.632 --> 42:53.632
♫ I've been alone into the unknown. ♫

42:53.772 --> 43:01.071
♫ Can navigate through the dark. ♫

43:01.072 --> 43:08.251
♫ I'm searching for a meadow of mine ♫

43:08.252 --> 43:14.851
♫ till you came in with the breeze. ♫

43:14.852 --> 43:22.272
♫ A feeling rushing out to me
spills my heart into the field ♫

43:22.452 --> 43:29.251
♫ I know it. I will be yours. ♫

